+# Actual consistent read substrate — no admission/proof grant
+
+Owned Grid successor from e3/docs/runtime40e. Existing `AssignmentAuthority.execute/reconcile` remain CLOSED; no `ResearchLabAuthority` positive issuer or public storage snapshot/proof endpoint is claimed by this slice.
+
+Implemented private `async AssignmentAuthority._read_snapshot(keys: tuple[str,...]) -> tuple[CapturedRecord,...]`: requires actual existing ConsulSessionAuthority with owned real httpx client/transport; validates unique1..64 keys inside its namespace, no dot segments/unsafe paths, each key<=1024; serializes the complete one-transaction read before send. Uses actual `/v1/txn?consistent` `get-or-empty` for each key. Result must be complete/unfiltered with a known leader. Each returned key/index/create index/session/raw canonical C3 value is validated; missing at THIS snapshot is index0/rawNone, not proof the original never committed. ACL denial/filtering/unknown/no quorum is not absence. CapturedRecord is immutable DATA, not an issuer-owned identity/closure/lease/dispatch capability.
+
+Private caller must derive the exact approved domain key set; this method is not an arbitrary client KV API. It does not authorize disclosure, validate object/worker/application schemas, qualify a current actor, or mint A4 NativeClosurePlan/NativeClosureCapture. Future public `capture_storage_snapshot` still requires exact co-approved original publication/closure-plan/source/record/current-access ABI and an A2 private snapshot inventory. A4 legacy sync always-denied local capture stays unchanged; new native type belongs only in its allocated `unified_system.storage.publication_records` or separately selected owned module.
+
+Semantics checked against official Consul1.22 docs: https://developer.hashicorp.com/consul/api-docs/v1.22.x/txn . Read-only transactions accept consistent mode; get-or-empty returns null for missing keys. Actual pinned1.22.2 observed response has existing raw Value/positive ModifyIndex and missing Value:null/CreateIndex0/ModifyIndex0. No timestamp/term/leader-fence inference from native QueryMeta.Index or ModifyIndex.
+
+Source-pinned initial RED6621362188384fa92e1ac8e45ddbfbb5db7218ac/tree51951d6eee1e6f4a4e838b8903a895d5a7f58fd2 used old module7d9f7c8488407b6ed60e781f75748a89c5d77cfce5925a16df583468ebd1895c and actual own3-voter/ACL probe: AttributeError for missing _read_snapshot, actual server get-or-empty response preserved. This Grid RED recorded committed HEAD/module, NOT a full fresh raw-pre/post source qualification; do not relabel it as the broker d45 full raw RED qualification.
