+Actual native tests use own temporary three-voter/default-deny ACL Consul1.22.2. Rows are explicitly `untrusted.native-snapshot-probe.v1`, never fake issued jobs/Assignments/receipts. Tests cover atomic existing+absent records, real restricted ACL denial, stale CAS rollback/no probe effect, all-node restart retaining actual raw/index, current leader failure with two remaining voters, bad/duplicate/outside keys/budget bounds, and exact one-of-three quorum loss/no cached success. Test helper restarts ONLY retained owned Popen handles/config/data, tracks all old/new handles and kills/waits them; no office services or PID/name scans.
+
+Final qualification is separate and must verify exact new source/unique mandatory18 tests (11 prior units +7 native groups) and both actual raw source inventories before/after. The 11 old units include a helper-cache negative fixture: its expected `not a git repository` child failure is a guard control, not failed native consensus. Bootstrap helper bytes ebca274... remain pinned and are present in support Unified1f6. New run_qualification uses the stronger exact OID/raw guard f155/e373 from pinned Unified source; no existing legacy11-count runner is relabelled as18.
+
+This is native read/CAS/failure substrate only. No positive job/resource/worker/publication/projection/payload-read/UTC/physical admission. Public submit DENY. Current Source-qualified P2 identity is separately PR58/1f6; Root3af composition/source qualification does not itself enable these effects.
